# 1. `Test::differs(Halfedge_Mesh const &source, Halfedge_Mesh const &target, CheckExtra check_extra)`

Defined **only** at `/workspace/src/test.cpp:466-657`. Returns `std::optional<std::string>` (nullopt == "same"). **The `check_extra` parameter is completely ignored** — line 467 is literally:

```cpp
